        "Description": "Your target Jason Portman.\rAGE: 35\r\r  Mr Portman is alive.  Drowning a target in a professional and high-tech Gamma clinic was not the best idea.  They saved his life.\r  Portman got the face of fashion model Helmut Krueger. The client is not satisfied.\r  \rPortman is a member of the most elite club - &quot;Ark of Society&quot;.\r  Your task is to free the target at the annual convention of his secret club.\r  This time, the client wished to burn out the infection from the inside.  Give him poison, 47.",
